## What to deliver

Build the soldier sprite sheet up operation by operation until each
`frames/<index>.png` matches the brief: a heavy, mandibled ant drawn in neutral
grey in each of its four 16×16 facing frames — down, up, left, and right. When you
are satisfied, stop: the recorded per-frame action logs are your finished
submission.
